    "level": 3,
    "canonicalUrl": "https://quasar.dev/vue-components/option-group#using-label-slots",
    "content": "There are two types of slots. A generic one (`label`) which applies to all options, unless a more specific index-based one is used (`label-N` where N is the 0-based index of the option). Both types of slots receive the respective option as parameter.\n\nNotice how we use the specific label slot for first option (option at index 0) and we also add a QTooltip.\n\nExample: Label slots (LabelSlots.vue)",
